            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 124PGB(1)(ha) and (i)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__para-i">
